abstract: >-
  Plans and list prices for 12 podcast hosting services plus Spotify for Creators,
  read off each host's own pricing page, and 19 verified price and plan changes
  since January 2023, each linked to Internet Archive copies of the pricing page
  before and after the change.
keywords:
  - podcasting
  - podcast hosting
  - pricing
  - price changes
  - SaaS pricing
